  unitName: Fire Nymph
  unitId: 10130
  unitNumber: 171
  description: A small nymph thought to be born from fire, one of the six elements
    created by the gods. Lively and erratic, it is always scheming while floating
    around. It often appears before people, but since it is unpredictable and may
    suddenly attack, it's perceived as an nuisance by most. Yet as it can grant special
    powers to others, many Summoners search for this fairy.
  summonDesc: I am a Fire Nymph!<br>You're pretty interesting.<br>Can I follow you?
